d settlement cycle for transactions in US securities1 will be shortened from two business days after the trade date (T+2) to one business day after trading (T+1) (the Transition)2. As such, the timeline for completing post-trade settlement processes3 will be compressed. The Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) is of the view that the impact of the Transition may be particularly significant for market participants in Hong Kong due to time zone differences.","unit_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u0.0"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC16 chars 498:877","normative":true,"span":{"end":877,"id":"s.d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u1.498","page":1,"quote_sha256":"4dc81bd9f7e00c84870ac20575b527d3a8083cf075a32fe1051f8292675f9632","raw_sha256":"268cbf7137c108f5a0246a76a396c29584c8c7724542138dbc9186e28bd91def","source_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b","start":498,"text_sha256":"27808e1b78f37e5fda442faa6ede66cc88107bdb91a0e8e286aed3d76d8b3156"},"text":"In this connection, the SFC wishes to remind licensed corporations (LCs) to assess the impact of the Transition on their businesses and take appropriate measures to maintain their smooth and effective operations after the Transition. These include enhancing their operational processes, technological infrastructure and systems as well as staffing arrangements where appropriate.","unit_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u1.498"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC16 chars 1916:2113","normative":true,"span":{"end":2113,"id":"s.d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u5.1916","page":1,"quote_sha256":"faf639f4cadfe3c8bef2df29f7b5033e716bc90d395f1a2b6dd9b42b0683cda9","raw_sha256":"268cbf7137c108f5a0246a76a396c29584c8c7724542138dbc9186e28bd91def","source_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b","start":1916,"text_sha256":"27808e1b78f37e5fda442faa6ede66cc88107bdb91a0e8e286aed3d76d8b3156"},"text":"Proactively engaging and communicating with their clients who are potentially affected by the Transition in order to raise their awareness and facilitate their preparations for a smooth transition.","unit_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u5.1916"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC16 chars 2116:2264","normative":true,"span":{"end":2264,"id":"s.d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u6.2116","page":1,"quote_sha256":"eda5dd84c8a68a63054d3803736a20de6023247e4040bea2c73fa8393fb43016","raw_sha256":"268cbf7137c108f5a0246a76a396c29584c8c7724542138dbc9186e28bd91def","source_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b","start":2116,"text_sha256":"27808e1b78f37e5fda442faa6ede66cc88107bdb91a0e8e286aed3d76d8b3156"},"text":"In addition, management companies of SFC-authorised funds (Funds), particularly those with considerable exposures to US securities, are reminded to:","unit_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u6.2116"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC16 chars 2267:2497","normative":true,"span":{"end":2497,"id":"s.d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u7.2267","page":1,"quote_sha256":"536f75ca0df2d162a620a817e6ae16300855a265d81a971ee63603d6e2814880","raw_sha256":"268cbf7137c108f5a0246a76a396c29584c8c7724542138dbc9186e28bd91def","source_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b","start":2267,"text_sha256":"27808e1b78f37e5fda442faa6ede66cc88107bdb91a0e8e286aed3d76d8b3156"},"text":"Carefully assess the impact of the Transition on their Funds, including any potential mismatches in settlement cycles relating to the deployment of subscription money or sale proceeds from non-US markets to purchase US securities;","unit_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u7.2267"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC16 chars 2499:2769","normative":true,"span":{"end":2769,"id":"s.d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u8.2499","page":1,"quote_sha256":"28043296ce8f15f49a0a22887f84ad3bb425e65bae447cf48b63fb9d21d6e010","raw_sha256":"268cbf7137c108f5a0246a76a396c29584c8c7724542138dbc9186e28bd91def","source_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b","start":2499,"text_sha256":"27808e1b78f37e5fda442faa6ede66cc88107bdb91a0e8e286aed3d76d8b3156"},"text":"Make appropriate arrangements where necessary, such as expanding pre-funding facilities and allocating additional staff to handle the compressed settlement timeline, to ensure that the Funds’ operations remain fair and orderly, and in the best interest of investors; and","unit_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u8.2499"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC16 chars 2771:2993","normative":true,"span":{"end":2993,"id":"s.d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u9.2771","page":1,"quote_sha256":"a5b8b48dace5dfffbd797ba775346a80e6a5bf9384245556370f9062d1b4cbc7","raw_sha256":"268cbf7137c108f5a0246a76a396c29584c8c7724542138dbc9186e28bd91def","source_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b","start":2771,"text_sha256":"27808e1b78f37e5fda442faa6ede66cc88107bdb91a0e8e286aed3d76d8b3156"},"text":"Give early alerts to the SFC and investors about any intended changes, issues or untoward circumstances arising from the Transition that may materially affect the Funds and investors, and take remedial actions accordingly.","unit_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u9.2771"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC16 chars 2996:3079","normative":true,"span":{"end":3079,"id":"s.d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u10.2996","page":1,"quote_sha256":"3f15ef85a8de1db6a7438a8ff06266e489facdd9f2627f501716eefb36bda6de","raw_sha256":"268cbf7137c108f5a0246a76a396c29584c8c7724542138dbc9186e28bd91def","source_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b","start":2996,"text_sha256":"27808e1b78f37e5fda442faa6ede66cc88107bdb91a0e8e286aed3d76d8b3156"},"text":"The SFC will continue to monitor market developments in relation to the Transition.","unit_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u10.2996"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC16 chars 3083:3171","normative":true,"span":{"end":3171,"id":"s.d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u11.3083","page":1,"quote_sha256":"0e3225addfcc2663ed547268443c0eda4c4b22cc50e1f858008119256b3a532c","raw_sha256":"268cbf7137c108f5a0246a76a396c29584c8c7724542138dbc9186e28bd91def","source_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b","start":3083,"text_sha256":"27808e1b78f37e5fda442faa6ede66cc88107bdb91a0e8e286aed3d76d8b3156"},"text":"Intermediaries Supervision Department                       Investment Products Division","unit_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u11.3083"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC16 chars 3172:3289","normative":true,"span":{"end":3289,"id":"s.d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u12.3172","page":1,"quote_sha256":"785d44c652b65df6766b7210a6c4ad86fba361d3eb7c7e10d9dae247a1b416f1","raw_sha256":"268cbf7137c108f5a0246a76a396c29584c8c7724542138dbc9186e28bd91def","source_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b","start":3172,"text_sha256":"27808e1b78f37e5fda442faa6ede66cc88107bdb91a0e8e286aed3d76d8b3156"},"text":"Intermediaries Division                                                             Securities and Futures Commission","unit_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u12.3172"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC16 chars 3290:3323","normative":true,"span":{"end":3323,"id":"s.d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u13.3290","page":1,"quote_sha256":"88e2bc94e9edc39f2ac1cdaaea86b44ab5ea59b31c446f69591f21bf460b005e","raw_sha256":"268cbf7137c108f5a0246a76a396c29584c8c7724542138dbc9186e28bd91def","source_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b","start":3290,"text_sha256":"27808e1b78f37e5fda442faa6ede66cc88107bdb91a0e8e286aed3d76d8b3156"},"text":"Securities and Futures Commission","unit_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u13.3290"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC16 chars 3336:3397","normative":true,"span":{"end":3397,"id":"s.d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u14.3336","page":1,"quote_sha256":"970b888c7fb9ee70753be5ec1f4519ef5882482f0389de2c2b6bd2953209f124","raw_sha256":"268cbf7137c108f5a0246a76a396c29584c8c7724542138dbc9186e28bd91def","source_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b","start":3336,"text_sha256":"27808e1b78f37e5fda442faa6ede66cc88107bdb91a0e8e286aed3d76d8b3156"},"text":"1 Such as equities, bonds, exchange-traded funds and options.","unit_id":"d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u14.3336"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?